      "text": "AND in the euening of the Sabboth which dawneth"
    },
    {
      "line_index": 1,
      "verse": "28:1",
      "text": "on the firſt of the Sabboth, came Marie Magdalene,"
    },
    {
      "line_index": 2,
      "verse": "28:1",
      "text": "and the other Marie ″ to ſee the ſepulchre. 2. And be-",
      "marks_present": [
        "″"
      ],
      "verse_starts_midline": [
        "28:2"
      ],
      "line_end_hyphen": true
    },
    {
      "line_index": 3,
      "verse": "28:2",
      "text": "hold there was made a great earth-quake. For an An-",
      "line_end_hyphen": true
    },
    {
      "line_index": 4,
      "verse": "28:2",
      "text": "gel of our Lord deſcended from Heauen : and com-",
      "line_end_hyphen": true
    },
    {
      "line_index": 5,
      "verse": "28:2",
      "text": "ming, roled back the ſtone, and ſate vpon it : 3. and his",
      "verse_starts_midline": [
        "28:3"
      ]
    },
    {
      "line_index": 6,
      "verse": "28:3",
      "text": "countenance was as lightning, and his garment as ſnow. 4. And for",
      "verse_starts_midline": [
        "28:4"
      ]
    },
    {
      "line_index": 7,
      "verse": "28:4",
      "text": "feare of him, the watchmen were frigited, and became as dead. 5. And",
      "verse_starts_midline": [
        "28:5"
      ]
    },
    {
      "line_index": 8,
      "verse": "28:5",
      "text": "the Angel anſwering ſaid to the women : Feare not you. For I know"
    },
    {
      "line_index": 9,
      "verse": "28:5",
      "text": "that you ſeeke Iesvs that was crucified. 6. He is not here , for he is",
      "verse_starts_midline": [
        "28:6"
      ]
    },
    {
      "line_index": 10,
      "verse": "28:6",
      "text": "riſen, * as he ſaid. Come , and ſee the place where our Lord was laid.",
      "marks_present": [
        "*"
      ]
    },
    {
      "line_index": 11,
      "verse": "28:7",
      "verse_number_printed": "7",
      "text": "7. And going quickly tel ye his Diſciples that he is riſen : and behold he"
    },
    {
      "line_index": 12,
      "verse": "28:7",
      "text": "goeth before you into Galilee : there you ſhal ſee him. Loe I haue fore-",
      "line_end_hyphen": true
    },
    {
      "line_index": 13,
      "verse": "28:7",
      "text": "told you."
    },
    {
      "line_index": 14,
      "verse": "28:8",
      "verse_number_printed": "8",
      "text": "8. And they went forth quickly out of the monument with feare"
    },
    {
      "line_index": 15,
      "verse": "28:8",
      "text": "and great ioy, running to tel his Diſciples. 9. And behold Iesvs met",
      "verse_starts_midline": [
        "28:9"
      ]
    },
    {
      "line_index": 16,
      "verse": "28:9",
      "text": "them, ſaying : Al haile. But they came neere and tooke hold of his feet,"
    },
    {
      "line_index": 17,
      "verse": "28:9",
      "text": "and adored him. 10. Then Iesvs ſaid to them : Feare not. Goe, tel my bre-",
      "verse_starts_midline": [
        "28:10"
      ],
      "line_end_hyphen": true
    },
    {
      "line_index": 18,
      "verse": "28:10",
      "text": "thren that they goe into Galilee, there they ſhal ſee me."
    },
    {
      "line_index": 19,
      "verse": "28:11",
      "verse_number_printed": "11",
      "text": "11. Who when they were departed, behold certaine of the watchmen"
    },
    {
      "line_index": 20,
      "verse": "28:11",
      "text": "came into the citie , and told the chiefe Prieſts al things that had been"
    },
    {
      "line_index": 21,
      "verse": "28:11",
      "text": "done. 12. And being aſſembled togeather with the Ancients, taking",
