      ]
    },
    {
      "line_index": 22,
      "verse": "28:12",
      "text": "counſel , they gaue a great ſumme of money to the ſouldiars, 13. ſaying:",
      "verse_starts_midline": [
        "28:13"
      ]
    },
    {
      "line_index": 23,
      "verse": "28:13",
      "text": "Say you, that his Diſciples came by night, and ſtole him away when we"
