      "verse": "28:13",
      "text": "were aſleep. 14. And if the Preſident ſhal heare of this, we wil perſuade",
      "verse_starts_midline": [
        "28:14"
      ]
    },
    {
      "line_index": 25,
      "verse": "28:14",
